@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam activityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
title Learning through errors (Appendix B)

start
:Pick one error example (E90–E102);
:Predict the diagnostic:\nwhere it points and which rule it breaks;
:Compile the fence as a lone ghost program;
if (Diagnostic matches the prediction?) then (yes)
  :Name the broken promise\nand the Reference rule;
else (no)
  :Reread the rule\nand revise your model;
endif
:Keep only one error at a time;
stop
@enduml
